{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Siren","id":"809288447151439872","is_bot":0,"username":"sirenssong17"},"author_id":"809288447151439872","channel_id":"850779383656218636","content":"Goodbye everyone. It has been fun getting to know you. Thank you to <@860303482065256448> <@185916549066915852> <@237577351532249110> <@692746345387130900> and <@403783497564684291> for being so kind. I just do not know enough about how to play on this server, to be able to accomplish things in time. Im no longer enjoying myself, as it has started to feel more like a job. I get how it could be fun for many people. Thanks for the opportunity. Goodbye.","created_at":"2021-07-18T21:01:36.130000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866424491364843550","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
