{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"850779383656218636","content":"You were one of my favorite players, you were so much fun to interact with! I'm so sorry this is more stressful than fun for you, if there is anything we can do to change that, just let me know, otherwise I totally understand, no hard feelings at all.\n\nI was so stressed out at first last year, loads of anxiety around being on a server this large with so many people and rules. I ended up making a lot of friends and would only play in events that were smaller where I had an ally who could help me. I completely understand how youre feeling. Just know that the DMs and players are all here for you. thank you for your creativity! you will be missed.","created_at":"2021-07-18T21:15:54.118000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866428090027474984","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
